<h1 class="text-center underline underline-offset-4 text-3xl font-medium mb-4">Add a custom species</h1>
<p class="max-w-sm mx-auto mb-4 text-sm text-center">
  Custom species are yours: they don't change the official catalog, and only you and people who can
  see a tank you stock them in will see them.
</p>

<%= render "form", species: @species %>

<p class="text-center mt-4"><%= link_to "Back to species", species_index_path, class: "underline" %></p>
